WEBVTT

00:05:28.516 --> 00:05:30.996
But no other tests were amiss,

00:05:30.996 --> 00:05:33.436
no sign of clogged arteries anywhere.

00:05:34.396 --> 00:05:38.796
Two weeks later, her emotional state
had returned to normal

00:05:38.796 --> 00:05:43.036
and so, an ultrasound confirmed,

00:05:43.076 --> 00:05:44.356
had her heart.

00:05:44.956 --> 00:05:50.916
Takotsubo cardiomyopathy has been linked
to many stressful situations,

00:05:50.916 --> 00:05:52.716
including public speaking --

00:05:53.036 --> 00:05:55.836
(Laughter)

00:05:58.756 --> 00:06:02.876
(Applause)